      "body": "### The problem\n\nThe German market moved to 15-minute resolution of prices today, and tibber is already billing to 15 minute prices\n\n<img width=\"603\" height=\"475\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/716d69ba-fb94-4a8e-8313-102668b1a8d9\" />\n\nHowever, Tibber integration still uses 1 hour averages and there is no way to use the 15 minute resolution right now.\n\n### What version of Home Assistant Core has the issue?\n\ncore-2025.9.4\n\n### What was the last working version of Home Assistant Core?\n\n_No response_\n\n### What type of installation are you running?\n\nHome Assistant OS\n\n### Integration causing the issue\n\nTibber\n\n### Link to integration documentation on our website\n\n_No response_\n\n### Diagnostics information\n\n_No response_\n\n### Example YAML snippet\n\n```yaml\n\n```\n\n### Anything in the logs that might be useful for us?\n\n```txt\n\n```\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
